# NumCrunch Academy
![Game Icon](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/moderatedan/NumCrunch-Academy/main/build/AppDir/usr/share/icons/hicolor/256x256/apps/numcrunch.png)

Math learning game for kids (Ages 6-12)

## Features
- Addition/Subtraction practice
- Progress tracking
- Portable AppImage format

## Download
Get the latest release:  
[![Download](https://img.shields.io/github/v/release/moderatedan/NumCrunch-Academy?label=Download&style=for-the-badge)](https://github.com/moderatedan/NumCrunch-Academy/releases/latest)

## Run Locally
```bash
chmod +x NumCrunch_Academy*.AppImage
./NumCrunch_Academy*.AppImage
```
